{"unit_id":"CLAPEILL__dsh-skill-manager#card-zh","repo":"CLAPEILL/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"3c32e1030a2a862a686928a6fbbf81c0a4056ad2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manager 是面向 DSH Web 的 skill 管理插件，通过设置页、对话头部和新对话输入区接入管理界面，并在宿主注册 skill provider 与管理接口。它可以全局启用或禁用 skill、为工作区设置新对话默认集合、为当前会话选择可用 skill，并删除用户目录中的 skill。状态保存在 DSH_HOME 下的插件数据文件中。适合需要按项目或对话控制 skill 集合的 DSH 用户；不需要 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:373-410","lib/client.js:1102-1129","lib/core.js:27-30"]}
{"unit_id":"CLAPEILL__dsh-skill-manager#card-en","repo":"CLAPEILL/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"3c32e1030a2a862a686928a6fbbf81c0a4056ad2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-skill-manager manages skills in DSH Web. It supports global enable or disable, workspace defaults for new chats, per-conversation selection, and deletion of user skills. State is kept in DSH plugin data; no API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:373-410","lib/client.js:1102-1129","lib/core.js:27-30"]}
