{"unit_id":"CLAPEILL__dsh-skill-manager#feature-1","repo":"CLAPEILL/dsh-skill-manager","commit":"3c32e1030a2a862a686928a6fbbf81c0a4056ad2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skill-manager 的功能「全局启用与禁用」：切换全局 skill 可用状态；禁用项通过不可调用的影子条目从模型目录和用户触发列表隐藏，原 skill 文件保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/provider.js:84-123"]}
